      "do": [
        {
          "kind": "showStep",
          "speaker": { "name": "马库斯", "portrait": "centurion" },
          "text": "骑兵不该替步兵硬扛；他们的价值在于抓住阵线转动的那一瞬间。",
          "boardLock": true,
          "highlight": { "unit": "recruit_cavalry", "hint": "骑兵已完成第二项操练" }
        },
        {
          "kind": "showStep",
          "speaker": { "name": "马库斯", "portrait": "centurion" },
          "text": "最后一项。炮兵走得最慢，却能在敌人靠近前开火。让他们站在该站的位置，别让敌人碰到他们。\n\n点击这段话，开始第三项操练。",
          "next": "__artillery_ready",
          "boardLock": true,
          "highlight": { "unit": "recruit_artillery", "hint": "炮兵已在远处架好火力" }
        },
        {
          "kind": "setUnitState",
          "target": { "unit": "recruit_cavalry" },
          "state": "canAct",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "setUnitState",
          "target": { "unit": "recruit_cavalry" },
          "state": "canMove",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "setUnitState",
